        "name": "Dual Onslaught",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>When you lash out with both weapons, you leave no room for the target to escape your attack.</p>\n<p>When you use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Double Slice], if you miss with both @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Strike]{Strikes}, choose one of the two weapons and apply the effects of a hit with that weapon.</p>\n<p>You can't choose a weapon if your attack roll with that weapon was a critical failure, meaning you still miss entirely if both attack rolls were critical failures.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Dual-Weapon Warrior Dedication"
              }
            ]
          },
